  "aiContextParagraph": "Following his participation in the 49th ASEAN Summit, President Prabowo Subianto attended the APEC 2026 summit gala dinner held in Shenzhen, China. During the event, the Indonesian president was seated alongside Russian President Vladimir Putin and Chinese President Xi Jinping. Reports indicate that President Subianto utilized the occasion to hold a brief discussion regarding bilateral issues between Indonesia and Russia. This high-level engagement follows a series of diplomatic events in the region, including the ASEAN-US special summit in Manila, where discussions focused on strategic regional concerns such as food security, the digital economy, and international policy positions. These summits serve as key venues for navigating global stability and strengthening diplomatic ties, with Singapore set to assume the ASEAN chairmanship in 2027 following the conclusion of the 49th summit proceedings in the Philippines.",
